{"날짜": "2026-09-12", "시험지명": "용인삼계고_고2_2025_2_중간", "루프ID": "20260912-CL-G2A-7fe5f2da", "문항": {"16": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">양의 정수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>에 대하여 함수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>를</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></p><p>이라 하자. 다음 조건을 만족시키는 모든 정수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></semantics></math>값의 곱이 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>이 되도록 하는 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>에 대하여 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>의 값은?</p><p><div class=\"box\"><div class=\"bl\">함수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>에 대하여 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>을 만족시키는 서로 다른 세 실수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>이 열린구간 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>에 존재한다.</div></div></p><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 16번 · 평균변화율"}, "17": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">실수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></semantics></math>에 대하여 함수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mtext> </mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>의 그래프가 직선 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>과 만나는 서로 다른 점의 개수를 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>라 하자. 양수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></semantics></math>에 대하여 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></semantics></math>일 때, 함수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>가 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>에서 불연속이 되도록 하는 실수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>의 개수를 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>라 하자. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></msubsup><mi>N</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>의 값은?</p><p></p><div class=\"pcs \"><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">①</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">②</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">③</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">④</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pch\"><span class=\"pcn\">⑤</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></div>", "유형": "기출 17번 · 함수의 그래프와 연속"}, "20": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">실수 전체의 집합에서 미분가능한 두 함수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>가 다음 조건을 만족시킬 때, 물음에 답하시오.</p><p><div class=\"box\"><div class=\"bl\">(가) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math></div><div class=\"bl\">(나) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\htmlClass</mtext></mstyle></mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>일 때, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math></div><div class=\"bl\">(다) 모든 실수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>에 대하여 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>2025</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></div></p><p>(1) (3.5점) 미분계수의 정의를 이용하여 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>의 값을 구하시오.</p><p>(2) (4.5점) 미분계수의 정의를 이용하여 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>의 값을 구하시오.</p><p></p></div>", "유형": "기출 20번 · 미분계수를 이용한 극한값의 계산"}}}